# Symlinks into the installed pi, created by tests/link-deps.mjs on first run.
# Nothing is vendored: the harness must exercise the exact pi-tui the running pi
# hands the extension, so these point at that install rather than a fetched copy.
node_modules/

# Unlike the teams extension, tests/ IS published here. Its fixtures are
# invented — a made-up "retry budget" design — so there is nothing local in them
# to keep off a clone, and they are most of what makes this extension reviewable.
